### Adjust the port to match `dotnet run` output
@host = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Catalog (DataSet). Call twice: X-Cache goes MISS -> HIT
GET {{host}}/api/products

### 2. Catalog filtered by category
GET {{host}}/api/products?category=Electronics

### 3. Single product (cached)
GET {{host}}/api/products/1

### 4. Create a product (invalidates cached catalogs)
POST {{host}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Webcam", "category": "Electronics", "price": 59.90, "stock": 12 }

### 5. Update a product
PUT {{host}}/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Mechanical Keyboard", "category": "Electronics", "price": 74.99, "stock": 25 }

### 6. Place an order (transaction across Orders, OrderItems, Products)
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerName": "Asha", "items": [ { "productId": 1, "quantity": 2 }, { "productId": 5, "quantity": 10 } ] }

### 7. Rollback demo: second line is impossible, so NOTHING is saved and stock is unchanged (409)
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerName": "Asha", "items": [ { "productId": 1, "quantity": 1 }, { "productId": 5, "quantity": 999999 } ] }

### 8. Read an order back
GET {{host}}/api/orders/1

### 9. Delete (409 if the product appears in an order)
DELETE {{host}}/api/products/6
